sentences.text:
His brother has filed complaint on 16.11.2017 after coming to know that the Police have not registered the case; before the Tribunal,
evidence has been placed in proof of the accident, but the Tribunal on the ground that the accident is not proven, dismissed the claim petition;
NC: 2024:KHC:1866 huge money was spent towards treatment, it is not a fake or fit case, rather it is a genuine case where the Tribunal doubted the veracity of the accident.

